## Findings

1. **Amendment faithfulness — the deferral stands.** Cycle 039 claims no operative landing. `INSTRUCTION.md` §5 leg 3b still assigns receipt reconciliation to the builder, and `guards/guards.md` command 7 requires CONFIG-to-application-site resolution without prescribing an independent validator. Cycle 037 `RUN.md` §9b.1 already names both owning surfaces, the acceptance test, and HQ as consumer. Carry the deferral on **both** layers in Cycle 039 §9.3. Describe the pattern as recurring: Waves 34–36 cleared **0/5, 1/5, and 0/5**, respectively, from the five rows for each of Waves 34 and 35 in `verdict-history.md` and the five Wave 36 final returns. Wave 35 interrupts the zero-clearance streak. The returns establish that deficient receipts reached prewave after builder checks. The cause and the validator’s effectiveness remain unestablished. [Cycle 037 RUN.md](../2026-11-18-cycle-037-wave-34/RUN.md#9b--codex-condense-firing-1-dispositions-revise-applied-in-full) · [Cycle 039 RUN.md](RUN.md)

2. **Four-layer coverage — replace the blanket NO-DEFECT dispositions in §9.3 and the “solely” basis in §9.5.**
