1. **Amendment faithfulness.** No operative amendment is claimed, and no amendment-theatre is evident in the text reviewed. `INSTRUCTION.md` §5 leg 3b still gives receipt reconciliation to the builder. `guards.md` command 7 requires CONFIG values to reach actual application sites. Cycle 037 §9b.1 names HQ as consumer and records the acceptance test for independent validation. Cycle 039 adds a concrete regression case: T232’s census lists `pipStyle` and claims an application site, while the HTML contains only its declaration. A key-list comparison would pass that case. The deferral is explicit on both owning layers. [`RUN.md` §9.1](RUN.md#9--condense-drafted-codex-condense-firing-follows-disposition-in-9b) · [`INSTRUCTION.md` §5](../../INSTRUCTION.md#5--verify-the-codex-scoring-wave--own-checks) · [`guards.md` commands](../../guards/guards.md#the-commands-mechanical-guards--callable-demonstrated) · [T232 census](../../../../study/recreations/T232-verb-literalization-dicing-dice/config-census.md#L28) · [T232 HTML](../../../../study/recreations/T232-verb-literalization-dicing-dice/recreation.html#L32)

