   - **Mechanical guards.** The revised Condense correctly records command 7’s `pipStyle` miss and command 6’s unreconciled fit evidence. T212’s row 6 gives 21 px at a scale of `360/640`, which yields **11.8125 px**, against the filed **11.2 px** minimum. T218’s proxy measures New Hampshire on one line, while the final SVG renders two. T219’s final return calls for reconciling the fit summary against its measured rows. These are concrete reasons to retain the named deferral. Command 4 was outside this cycle’s executed checks because the scoring wave never fired. [T212 fit table](../../../../study/recreations/T212-margin-bar-field/fit-table.md#L14) · [T218 final prewave return](../../../../study/recreations/T218-north-south-population-tiles/codex/jev-prewave-refire.md#L16) · [T219 final prewave return](item-T219-jev-prewave-2-return.md#L14)
   - **Jev definitions.** T218’s two lowest scores of **0.5** leave the strict **<0.5** floor untriggered. Guidance scored **1.0**, so the guidance exception is inapplicable to this return. The definition also allows RETURN for an unnamed gap, and the return does not cite that clause. Record that the classification basis was unstated and that the runner advanced after the fine-frame census while setting continuous playback aside. The separately recorded scope discrepancy also stands: T218’s prewave return reports selected Node probes, and the call defines a paperwork judgment. [T218 Observe-exit return](item-T218-jev-observe-exit-return.md) · [Jev Observe-exit §5](../../guards/jev-observe-exit.md#5--floors-and-disposition) · [T218 Observe/Plan §2b](item-T218-observe-plan.md#L121) · [Jev prewave charge](../../guards/jev-prewave.md#2-instruction-the-models-charge)
   - **Codex prompts.** The four first-attempt records contain **eight Codex and eight Jev Phase A returns**, with two of each per item. T219’s numerals-with-squares correction and T232’s timing-swap correction support retaining the respective review prompts. The stale firing-state claims in Plan review and Condense remain explicitly deferred, and the scoring prompt was outside this wave’s demands. [T219 Observe return](item-T219-codex-observe-return.md#L7) · [T232 Plan return](item-T232-codex-plan-review-return.md#L5) · [Cycle 038 Condense](../2026-11-18-cycle-038-wave-35/RUN.md#9--condense)

